-- Lesson 6. Choosing.

please remember score is 7

please check if score is over 10:
    show "That is a lot."
otherwise if score is over 5:
    show "That is respectable."
otherwise:
    show "Early days."
thank you for checking

-- Ways to ask a question.
please check if score is 7:
    show "exactly seven"
thanks
please check if score is not 3:
    show "not three"
thanks
please check if score is at least 5 and score is at most 9:
    show "somewhere in the middle"
thanks
please check if score is between 1 and 10:
    show "between one and ten"
thanks

-- Indentation is only there to help you read. This runs just the same.
please check if score is over 5:
show "badly indented, and perfectly fine"
thanks
